    <detaileddescription>
<para>custom hash for std::tuple&lt;int, int, int&gt;</para>
<para>The STL uses just uses the function <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">std::size_t<sp/>operator()(</highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>std::tuple&lt;int,<sp/>int,<sp/>int&gt;&amp;<sp/>t)</highlight><highlight class="keyword"><sp/>const<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::size_t<sp/>h1<sp/>=<sp/>std::hash&lt;int&gt;{}(std::get&lt;0&gt;(t));<sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Hash<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>first<sp/>element</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::size_t<sp/>h2<sp/>=<sp/>std::hash&lt;int&gt;{}(std::get&lt;1&gt;(t));<sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Hash<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>second<sp/>element</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::size_t<sp/>h3<sp/>=<sp/>std::hash&lt;int&gt;{}(std::get&lt;2&gt;(t));<sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Hash<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>third<sp/>element</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Combine<sp/>the<sp/>hashes<sp/>using<sp/>XOR<sp/>and<sp/>bit-shifting</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>h1<sp/>^<sp/>(h2<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>1)<sp/>^<sp/>(h3<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>2);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
